msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"They say there was a shooting at Canal Grande. I hope my favorite hostess is"
" okay."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I wanna pay her a visit, but the club's gonna be closed for a while. Dammit!"
" I can't stand not knowing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I'm sure she's fine. I heard all the employees were able to get away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Oh... That's a relief."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"Then again, if she did get hurt I could surprise her at the hospital with "
"some flowers. Maybe then I'll finally get her to like me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Wait, no! That sounds like I wanted her to get hurt! Ugh. Love is "
"complicated, man..."
msgstr ""

